Description: fate/cbs: test the mantissas of the 3D reference displays information
 .
 Rewrite a stream whose 3D reference displays information SEI message
 (payloadType 176) has mantissas of 20, 30, 40 and 45 bits through
 hevc_metadata, which decomposes the stream and recomposes it, and check
 that the result is the input.
 .
 The sample is the conformance stream ipcm_A_NEC_3.bit with the prefix
 SEI NAL unit added before its first slice, made by the script attached
 to the pull request.
 .
 Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
